PrZip is an independent project, not affiliated with 7-Zip or with Igor Pavlov.
It reads and writes the 7z format and reads RAR, TAR, GZip, BZip2, XZ and ISO 9660.
Whatever the public 7z format documentation does not cover was established by
black-box tests against the official 7z.exe, never from the 7-Zip source code
(see docs/PROVENANCE.md and docs/FORMAT.md).

